            <ArticleTitle>Managing postoperative pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>560-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The postoperative course of a patient can be complicated by events such as pain, nausea and vomiting. These in themselves can have a significant impact upon morbidity and even survival. This article outlines key points to minimize such adverse outcomes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
